OL,3,GNEWSANew #1.8m market hopes to attract
OL,4,Acustomer boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #1.8m market has opened in a Cheshire
OL,7,Ftown to replace a 1960s indoor market
OL,8,Fdue for demolition.
OL,10,FCheshire West and Chester Council has
OL,11,Frelocated Northwich Market to from
OL,12,FWeaver Square to Barons Quay.
OL,14,FThe development first opened a decade
OL,15,Fago, but a number of empty units remain
OL,16,Fin the site.
OL,18,FCouncillor Nathan Pardoe, from Cheshire
OL,19,FWest and Chester Council, said he hoped
OL,20,Fthe new market would bring more people
OL,21,Finto the town centre.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
